# Journeyman: everything EXCEPT common, 415 legal cards, an 80-deck field with
# real players in it (v4 Journeyman's Control). The largest non-standard field,
# so a placement there means the most.
#
# No seed partition: this agent is alone in its arena and the whole legal pool
# is its own.
ABAGENT_ARENA=journeyman
ABAGENT_FLAGS=--seed-mod 1 --seed-rem 0 --theme-mod 2 --theme-rem 0 --slice 40 --floor-frac 0.70
